# OpenAI SDK types

Import and annotate with the types the Agents SDK exports. Do not add a `type` import modifier, and do not fill generic slots with `any`.

```typescript
import { Agent, run, setDefaultOpenAIKey, Tool } from '@openai/agents';

createTriageAgent(name: string, instructions: string, handoffs: Agent[]) {
  return Agent.create({ name, instructions, handoffs });
}

async runAgent(prompt: string, agent: Agent) {
  return await run(agent, prompt);
}
```

`Agent` and `Tool` are already the SDK types. `Agent<any, any>` and `import { type Tool }` are not.
